sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as 前端 (AgentChat/Settings/McpPanel)
    participant API as Express /api (requestId 中间件 + auth)
    participant LOG as utils/logger (ALS requestId)
    participant ROUTE as 业务路由
    participant SVC as 服务层 (registry/fts/settings)
    participant DB as SQLite (app_settings/global_memories/audit_logs/FTS)

    %% ── R3: requestId 链路 ──
    User->>FE: 操作
    FE->>API: HTTP 请求 (X-Request-Id 返回)
    API->>API: requestId 中间件：生成 UUID，runWithRequest，写响应头
    API->>LOG: 入口日志 (method path status duration, rid)
    API->>ROUTE: 路由处理（logger 自动带 rid）
    ROUTE-->>API: 响应 / 错误(safeErrorMessage 脱敏)
    API-->>FE: 响应 (X-Request-Id)
    FE->>FE: api/client.ts 读取 X-Request-Id（失败提示附带 requestId）

    %% ── R4: 审批开关读写链 ──
    FE->>API: GET /api/agent/settings/approval
    API->>ROUTE: agentRouter.get (L202)
    ROUTE->>SVC: isApprovalRequired()
    SVC->>SVC: 内存值（启动时自 settingsStore 加载）
    SVC-->>ROUTE: {approvalRequired}
    ROUTE-->>FE: 200 {approvalRequired}

    FE->>API: POST /api/agent/settings/approval {enabled:false, confirm:true}
    API->>API: auth 中间件（无鉴权 → 401，审计 rejected）
    API->>ROUTE: agentRouter.post (L206)
    ROUTE->>ROUTE: enabled===false && confirm!==true → 400
    ROUTE->>SVC: setApprovalRequired(false)
    SVC->>DB: settingsStore.set('approval.required', false)
    SVC->>DB: logApprovalToggle → audit_logs(approval_toggle)
    ROUTE-->>FE: 200 {approvalRequired:false}

    %% ── R2: 记忆检索链 ──
    FE->>API: POST /api/agent/chat (memoryInject=1)
    API->>ROUTE: agentRouter.post /chat
    ROUTE->>SVC: AgentCore.loadGlobalMemories (core.ts L164)
    SVC->>SVC: searchAllMemories(query, topK*2)
    SVC->>SVC: localMemoryProvider.search
    SVC->>SVC: TTL 缓存命中？是→返回
    SVC->>DB: fts.searchCandidateIds：unicode61 MATCH / trigram MATCH / LIKE 兜底 (LIMIT 100)
    DB-->>SVC: 候选 id 集合
    SVC->>DB: SELECT * FROM global_memories WHERE id IN (...)
    SVC->>SVC: tokenize + score 精排 → topK → 写缓存(60s)
    SVC-->>ROUTE: 记忆注入文本
    ROUTE-->>FE: SSE 流

    %% ── R5: MCP 连接注册链 ──
    FE->>API: POST /api/mcp/:id/connect
    API->>ROUTE: mcpRouter.post /:id/connect
    ROUTE->>SVC: mcpManager.connect(id)
    SVC->>SVC: client.listTools() → toolList
    SVC->>SVC: allowedSet = allowedTools ?? []（fail-closed）
    loop 每个工具
        SVC->>SVC: allowedSet 为空/不在白名单 → 跳过注册
        SVC->>SVC: dangerous = isDangerousToolName(name)
        SVC->>SVC: toolRegistry.register(requiresApproval:true, dangerous)
    end
    SVC-->>ROUTE: McpConnectionStatus(tools 已过滤)
    ROUTE-->>FE: {status}

    %% ── R5: 执行时两层审批门 ──
    FE->>API: POST /api/agent/tools/execute {toolName: mcp__S__write_file}
    API->>ROUTE: agentRouter.post /tools/execute
    ROUTE->>SVC: executeTool(name, args, ctx)
    SVC->>SVC: mustApprove = approvalRequired || tool.dangerous===true
    SVC->>SVC: requiresApproval && mustApprove → PENDING_APPROVAL（危险工具不可豁免）
    SVC->>DB: logAudit
    SVC-->>ROUTE: ToolResult
    ROUTE-->>FE: 结果
